		    	        <span class="news-headline-text-large"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=39">MIDNIGHT CLUB: LOS ANGELES – SOUTH CENTRAL DOWNLOADABLE CONTENT COMING MARCH 12TH</a></span><br>
        <span class="news-headline-text-date">02.25.09<br/><br/></span>
        <div id="article-text">The Midnight Club: Los Angeles – South Central downloadable content will be available on March 12th for both the Xbox 360® video game and entertainment system from Microsoft and for PLAYSTATION®3 computer entertainment system.<br><br>South Central offers more streets to race in with the free <b>South Central Map Expansion</b> which expands Midnight Club: Los Angeles by one third, adding four new neighborhoods to make up the iconic district of South Central.  <b>The South Central Premium Upgrade</b> is the total South Central experience for Midnight Club: Los Angeles delivering 9 new vehicles, 26 new races, 12 new battle maps, 10 new delivery missions, over 100 new red light races, new vinyl packs, new parts, new music and more all for the cost of $9.99.<br><br>The free South Central Map Expansion will ensure that every racer with either Xbox 360® or PLAYSTATION®3 copies of the game can race online against players that have the South Central Premium Upgrade.<br><br>The South Central Map Expansion features:<br><ul><li>Map expansion by one third</li><li>Four new neighborhoods</li><li>Price: FREE for both Xbox 360 and PLAYSTATION 3</li></ul><br>The South Central Premium Upgrade features:<br><ul><li>Nine new vehicles:<br><b>Luxury:</b> 2008 Mercedes-Benz CLK63 AMG "Black" <b>SUV:</b> 2008 Range Rover Supercharged, 2008 Range Rover Sport Super Charged <b>Lowrider:</b> 1955 Chevy Bel Air, 1963 Buick Riviera, 1964 Chevy Impala, 1965 Chevy Malibu <b>Muscle:</b> 1970 Chevy Chevelle, 1966 Pontiac GTO</li><li>26 new races</li><li>12 new battle maps</li><li>10 new delivery missions</li><li>100+ new red light races</li><li>New rims</li><li>New body kits for each new car</li><li>New vinyl pre-sets</li><li>Hydraulics/Airbags unlocked on all new cars</li<li>New music</li><li>Price: $9.99 for PLAYSTATION 3 and 800 MS points for Xbox 360</li></ul><br><br>More car packs are also set to come soon, stay tuned to the official site for more details, including the debut trailer.</div><br>
        <span class="toplink"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=39">READ MORE</a></span>
        <div id="article-item-spacer">.</div>
    
    
        	        <span class="news-headline-text-large"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=38">MIDNIGHT CLUB LOS ANGELES SOUTH CENTRAL SITE LAUNCH NEXT WEEK</a></span><br>
        <span class="news-headline-text-date">02.20.09<br/><br/></span>
        <div id="article-text">Stay tuned next week for the unveiling of the official website for Midnight Club: Los Angeles - South Central, including the launch of the game’s debut trailer.<br><br>South Central is the massive downloadable map expansion and premium upgrade for Midnight Club: Los Angeles that includes an entire new city area for free, as well as a premium upgrade pack that features all-new vehicles, races, music and more.  Release details coming soon.</div><br>
        <span class="toplink"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=38">READ MORE</a></span>
        <div id="article-item-spacer">.</div>
    
    
        	        <span class="news-headline-text-large"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=37">MIDNIGHT CLUB LOS ANGELES OFFICIAL WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP SERIES</a></span><br>
        <span class="news-headline-text-date">02.02.09<br/><br/></span>
        <div id="article-text">Eligible gamers across the globe will now have the chance to battle for supremacy in the Midnight Club: Los Angeles Official World Championship Series.</div><br>
        <span class="toplink"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=37">READ MORE</a></span>
        <div id="article-item-spacer">.</div>
    
    
        	        <span class="news-headline-text-large"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=36">MIDNIGHT CLUB LOS ANGELES AT THE DETROIT AUTO SHOW JANUARY 17th – 25th, 2009 AT THE COBO CENTER</a></span><br>
        <span class="news-headline-text-date">12.12.08<br/><br/></span>
        <div id="article-text">Rockstar Games and Midnight Club Los Angeles will be on hand at this year’s North American International Auto Show at the Cobo Center in Detroit, MI – considered internationally to be one of the world’s premier automotive annual events.</div><br>
        <span class="toplink"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=36">READ MORE</a></span>
        <div id="article-item-spacer">.</div>
    
    
        	        <span class="news-headline-text-large"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=35">SOCIAL CLUB WEEKEND DETAILS – GAME WITH ROCKSTAR AND ENTER THE MIDNIGHT CLUB LOS ANGELES TOURNAMENT</a></span><br>
        <span class="news-headline-text-date">12.12.08<br/><br/></span>
        <div id="article-text">Play Midnight Club Los Angeles online this weekend as part of the Social Club Weekend and go to <a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/socialclub/" target="_blank">Rockstar Games Social Club</a> for chances to compete for limited-edition Rockstar gear and prizes.</div><br>
        <span class="toplink"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=35">READ MORE</a></span>
        <div id="article-item-spacer">.</div>
    
    
        	        <span class="news-headline-text-large"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=34">SOUTH CENTRAL UPGRADE AND CONTENT PACK FOR MIDNIGHT CLUB LOS ANGELES ANNOUNCED</a></span><br>
        <span class="news-headline-text-date">12.12.08<br/><br/></span>
        <div id="article-text">Today we are proud to announce the South Central Upgrade and Content Pack for Midnight Club Los Angeles.</div><br>
        <span class="toplink"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=34">READ MORE</a></span>
        <div id="article-item-spacer">.</div>
    
    
        	        <span class="news-headline-text-large"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=33">MIDNIGHT CLUB LOS ANGELES XBOX LIVE EVENT THIS SUNDAY NOV 16TH</a></span><br>
        <span class="news-headline-text-date">11.14.08<br/><br/></span>
        <div id="article-text">Jump on Xbox LIVE® this Sunday for a chance to play Midnight Club Los Angeles multiplayer with members of Rockstar, including some key game developers and designers at Rockstar San Diego, as well as soundtrack artist MURS.</div><br>
        <span class="toplink"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=33">READ MORE</a></span>
        <div id="article-item-spacer">.</div>
    
    
        	        <span class="news-headline-text-large"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=32">MIDNIGHT CLUB LOS ANGELES REVIEWS ROUNDUP</a></span><br>
        <span class="news-headline-text-date">11.07.08<br/><br/></span>
        <div id="article-text">Continued high praise for the next generation debut of the genre-defining Midnight Club series:<br><br>"Midnight Club Los Angeles is an amazing racing game... The action is top shelf. A ton of real-world cars are available that look, handle and get damaged just like their non-virtual counterparts. All kinds of after-market add-ons let you fully pimp your ride. And the lack of game load time means dropping into the open world of greater L.A. and choosing a racing challenge is seamless and fast." – <a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.latimes.com/technology/la-et-gamedayreview22-2008oct22,0,4472726.story" target="_blank">The Los Angeles Times</a><br><br></div><br>
        <span class="toplink"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=32">READ MORE</a></span>
        <div id="article-item-spacer">.</div>
    
    
        	        <span class="news-headline-text-large"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=31">XBOX LIVE EVENT COMING SUNDAY NOVEMBER 16th – GAME WITH MEMBERS OF ROCKSTAR – AS WELL AS SOUNDTRACK ARTIST MURS</a></span><br>
        <span class="news-headline-text-date">11.07.08<br/><br/></span>
        <div id="article-text">Next Sunday, Nov 16th from 4 PM - 7 PM EST, jump into Midnight Club Los Angeles multiplayer matchmaking on XBOX LIVE® for your first opportunity to go toe to toe with the creators of the game - as a host of Rockstars including some of the key game developers and designers at Rockstar San Diego - pull up to the starting line, ready to make you look silly.</div><br>
        <span class="toplink"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=31">READ MORE</a></span>
        <div id="article-item-spacer">.</div>
    
    
        	        <span class="news-headline-text-large"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=30">ANNOUNCING THE FIVE FOUR CLOTHING MIDNIGHT CLUB LOS ANGELES SWEEPSTAKES</a></span><br>
        <span class="news-headline-text-date">11.07.08<br/><br/></span>
        <div id="article-text">Five Four Clothing and Rockstar Games have teamed up to bring you a chance to win a custom kit prize pack in the Five Four / Midnight Club Los Angeles Sweepstakes.</div><br>
        <span class="toplink"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=30">READ MORE</a></span>
        <div id="article-item-spacer">.</div>
    
    
        	        <span class="news-headline-text-large"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=29">NEW DOWNLOADABLE DESKTOPS</a></span><br>
        <span class="news-headline-text-date">11.07.08<br/><br/></span>
        <div id="article-text">The <a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/downloads/" target="_blank">DOWNLOADS</a> section of the official site has been updated with all-new desktops, featuring some of Midnight Club Los Angeles' most popular rides.</div><br>
        <span class="toplink"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=29">READ MORE</a></span>
        <div id="article-item-spacer">.</div>
    
    
        	        <span class="news-headline-text-large"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=28">CALLING ALL MIDNIGHT CLUB FANS ACROSS THE UK: WIN A DUB EDITION SALEEN S281 3–VALVE</a></span><br>
        <span class="news-headline-text-date">10.27.08<br/><br/></span>
        <div id="article-text">Rockstar London are giving away a money-can't-buy Saleen S281 3-Valve, a beast of an American muscle car fully customized by the maestros at DUB Magazine. Plus hundreds of runner-up prizes are up for grabs including t-shirts, caps, remote control cars and branded car paraphernalia.</div><br>
        <span class="toplink"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=28">READ MORE</a></span>
        <div id="article-item-spacer">.</div>
    
    
        	        <span class="news-headline-text-large"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=27">MIDNIGHT CLUB LOS ANGELES IN STORES NOW</a></span><br>
        <span class="news-headline-text-date">10.21.08<br/><br/></span>
        <div id="article-text">Midnight Club Los Angeles is now available for the Xbox 360® and PLAYSTATION®3 computer entertainment system.</div><br>
        <span class="toplink"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=27">READ MORE</a></span>
        <div id="article-item-spacer">.</div>
    
    
        	        <span class="news-headline-text-large"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=26">OFFICIAL TRAILER #4 AND POLICE PURSUIT VIDEO NOW LIVE</a></span><br>
        <span class="news-headline-text-date">10.21.08<br/><br/></span>
        <div id="article-text">To celebrate the launch of Midnight Club Los Angeles, we've added two new videos to the official site.</div><br>
        <span class="toplink"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=26">READ MORE</a></span>
        <div id="article-item-spacer">.</div>
    
    
        	        <span class="news-headline-text-large"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=25">CHECK OUT MIDNIGHT CLUB LOS ANGELES AT THE ROCKSTAR SOCIAL CLUB</a></span><br>
        <span class="news-headline-text-date">10.21.08<br/><br/></span>
        <div id="article-text">Make sure you're signed up at the Rockstar Games Social Club to extend your Midnight Club Los Angeles experience.</div><br>
        <span class="toplink"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=25">READ MORE</a></span>
        <div id="article-item-spacer">.</div>
    
    
        	        <span class="news-headline-text-large"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=24">GAME INFORMER REVIEW</a></span><br>
        <span class="news-headline-text-date">10.21.08<br/><br/></span>
        <div id="article-text">The latest issue of Game Informer features a full page review of Midnight Club Los Angeles.</div><br>
        <span class="toplink"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=24">READ MORE</a></span>
        <div id="article-item-spacer">.</div>
    
    
        	        <span class="news-headline-text-large"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=23">MUSIC SECTION LAUNCH - OFFICIAL SOUNDTRACK REVEALED</a></span><br>
        <span class="news-headline-text-date">10.21.08<br/><br/></span>
        <div id="article-text">Today's update features the first details about the full in-game soundtrack - a whopping collection of amped-up music perfect to race and ride to - from both cutting-edge underground artists and established legends.</div><br>
        <span class="toplink"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=23">READ MORE</a></span>
        <div id="article-item-spacer">.</div>
    
    
        	        <span class="news-headline-text-large"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=22">MIDNIGHT CLUB L.A. REMIX SECTION OPENED</a></span><br>
        <span class="news-headline-text-date">10.17.08<br/><br/></span>
        <div id="article-text">The successor to the best-selling racing game of all time on the PSP® (PlayStation®Portable) system is also coming this Tuesday.</div><br>
        <span class="toplink"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=22">READ MORE</a></span>
        <div id="article-item-spacer">.</div>
    
    
        	        <span class="news-headline-text-large"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=21">OFFICIAL SITE UPDATE – BEVERLY HILLS SECTION OPENED, OFFICIAL WIDGET &amp; SCREENSAVER UPDATED AND MORE</a></span><br>
        <span class="news-headline-text-date">10.17.08<br/><br/></span>
        <div id="article-text">The final stop in our tour around L.A. before the release of Midnight Club Los Angeles - arrives with a preview of the fully loaded luxury sedans and exotic sports cars of Beverly Hills.</div><br>
        <span class="toplink"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=21">READ MORE</a></span>
        <div id="article-item-spacer">.</div>
    
    
        	        <span class="news-headline-text-large"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=20">LIVE LAUNCH EVENT FEATURING EAGLES OF DEATH METAL AT THE VIRGIN MEGASTORE IN LOS ANGELES</a></span><br>
        <span class="news-headline-text-date">10.17.08<br/><br/></span>
        <div id="article-text">We will be kicking off the release of Midnight Club Los Angeles quite appropriately with a special live in-store performance by soundtrack artists Eagles of Death Metal at the Hollywood &amp; Highland Virgin Megastore location.</div><br>
        <span class="toplink"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=20">READ MORE</a></span>
        <div id="article-item-spacer">.</div>
    
    
        	        <span class="news-headline-text-large"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=19">ROCKSTAR AND JORDAN BRAND PRESENT: THE LIMITED-EDITION MIDNIGHT CLUB AIR JORDAN II</a></span><br>
        <span class="news-headline-text-date">10.17.08<br/><br/></span>
        <div id="article-text">Rockstar is proud to announce this special collaboration with Jordan Brand which has yielded the limited-edition Midnight Club Air Jordan II.</div><br>
        <span class="toplink"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=19">READ MORE</a></span>
        <div id="article-item-spacer">.</div>
    
    
        	        <span class="news-headline-text-large"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=18">MULTIPLAYER MODES UNVEILED AND PREVIEWED</a></span><br>
        <span class="news-headline-text-date">10.09.08<br/><br/></span>
        <div id="article-text">Today's official site update features the unveiling of Midnight Club Los Angeles' Multiplayer modes. <a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/#/multiplayer/" target="_blank">Click here</a> for the newly opened Multiplayer section of the official site, with full info on all the modes, plus a nifty new gallery of Multiplayer action screens.</div><br>
        <span class="toplink"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=18">READ MORE</a></span>
        <div id="article-item-spacer">.</div>
    
    
        	        <span class="news-headline-text-large"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=17">OFFICIAL SITE UPDATE – HOLLYWOOD HILLS SECTION OPENED WITH NEW CARS AND VIDEO CLIPS REVEALED</a></span><br>
        <span class="news-headline-text-date">10.09.08<br/><br/></span>
        <div id="article-text">The <a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/hollywoodhills" target="_blank">HOLLYWOOD HILLS</a> section of the <a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/" target="_blank">Official Website</a> is now open, showcasing 5 more vehicles from the in-game collection of aspirational licensed cars and bikes – including videos of the cult-classic '99 Nissan Skyline GT-R V-Spec and the Ducati 999R, as well as 3D screenshots of those models plus the Mitsubishi Lancer Evolution IX MR, the '69 Mustang Boss 302 and the '71 Lamborghini Miura.</div><br>
        <span class="toplink"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=17">READ MORE</a></span>
        <div id="article-item-spacer">.</div>
    
    
        	        <span class="news-headline-text-large"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=16">WIN THE SALEEN S302 EXTREME IN THE MIDNIGHT CLUB LOS ANGELES &amp; PIZZA HUT $100,000 CAR GIVEAWAY</a></span><br>
        <span class="news-headline-text-date">10.09.08<br/><br/></span>
        <div id="article-text">Rockstar and Pizza Hut have teamed up to give away a one-of-a-kind Saleen S302 Extreme dream car, as seen on the cover of Midnight Club Los Angeles.</div><br>
        <span class="toplink"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=16">READ MORE</a></span>
        <div id="article-item-spacer">.</div>
    
    
        	        <span class="news-headline-text-large"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=15">OFFICIAL SOUNDTRACK SAMPLER GIVEAWAYS AT FOOT ACTION</a></span><br>
        <span class="news-headline-text-date">10.09.08<br/><br/></span>
        <div id="article-text">Stop by any Foot Action store nationwide and receive an exclusive Midnight Club Los Angeles promo disc with any purchase - featuring three mp3s from the in-game soundtrack - including tracks by Kidz in the Hall, Get Cool and J Mill, as well as other exclusive Midnight Club Los Angeles downloads.</div><br>
        <span class="toplink"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=15">READ MORE</a></span>
        <div id="article-item-spacer">.</div>
    
    
        	        <span class="news-headline-text-large"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=14">NEW SPECIAL ABILITIES VIDEO CLIP</a></span><br>
        <span class="news-headline-text-date">09.22.08<br/><br/></span>
        <div id="article-text">New to the official site today, a video showcasing one of the Midnight Club series' returning fan-favorite gameplay features -- the Special Abilities.</div><br>
        <span class="toplink"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=14">READ MORE</a></span>
        <div id="article-item-spacer">.</div>
    
    
        	        <span class="news-headline-text-large"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=13">OFFICIAL SITE UPDATE – DOWNTOWN L.A., 5 NEW CARS REVEALED, VIDEO CLIPS, 3D SCREENS AND MORE</a></span><br>
        <span class="news-headline-text-date">09.18.08<br/><br/></span>
        <div id="article-text">Today - the launch of the <a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/downtown" target="_blank">Downtown Los Angeles page</a> features a healthy dose of new cars revealed from the in-game Midnight Club Los Angeles collection - heavy on all-American muscle cars like the Dodge Charger SRT-8 and the '69 Camaro RS SS - plus the hot, speedy tuner, the Mazda RX-8 Shinka.</div><br>
        <span class="toplink"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=13">READ MORE</a></span>
        <div id="article-item-spacer">.</div>
    
    
        	        <span class="news-headline-text-large"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=12">OFFICIAL WIDGET &amp; SCREENSAVER UPDATE</a></span><br>
        <span class="news-headline-text-date">09.18.08<br/><br/></span>
        <div id="article-text">Today's update includes new content that's been added to the Official Widget and Screensaver.</div><br>
        <span class="toplink"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=12">READ MORE</a></span>
        <div id="article-item-spacer">.</div>
    
    
        	        <span class="news-headline-text-large"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=11">NEW SPECIAL VIDEO CLIP: CUSTOMIZATION</a></span><br>
        <span class="news-headline-text-date">09.03.08<br/><br/></span>
        <div id="article-text">The <a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/videos" target="_blank">VIDEOS</a> section of the official site has been updated with a <a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/videos/?id=13" target="_blank">special clip</a> focusing on vehicle customization in Midnight Club Los Angeles.  The video, featuring the Mitsubishi Lancer Evolution IX MR, showcases extensive modifications including the debut of fully customized interiors, along with a look at some of the infinite paint options, concept body parts and custom vinyls.</div><br>
        <span class="toplink"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=11">READ MORE</a></span>
        <div id="article-item-spacer">.</div>
    
    
        	        <span class="news-headline-text-large"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=10">OFFICIAL SITE UPDATE – NEW CARS REVEALED, SANTA MONICA SECTION OPENED, AND MORE</a></span><br>
        <span class="news-headline-text-date">09.02.08<br/><br/></span>
        <div id="article-text">Today, five more cars from the Midnight Club Los Angeles in-game collection are revealed.</div><br>
        <span class="toplink"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=10">READ MORE</a></span>
        <div id="article-item-spacer">.</div>
    
    
        	        <span class="news-headline-text-large"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=9">OFFICIAL WIDGET &amp; DOWNLOADS UPDATED</a></span><br>
        <span class="news-headline-text-date">09.02.08<br/><br/></span>
        <div id="article-text">The Official Midnight Club Los Angeles Widget has been updated with an entirely new CARS section, where all the vehicles featured on the official site will appear dynamically as they're revealed, including today's latest set.</div><br>
        <span class="toplink"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=9">READ MORE</a></span>
        <div id="article-item-spacer">.</div>
    
    
        	        <span class="news-headline-text-large"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=8">FULL AFTERMARKET PARTS LIST REVEALED</a></span><br>
        <span class="news-headline-text-date">09.02.08<br/><br/></span>
        <div id="article-text">Today's official site update includes the unveiling of the complete aftermarket parts list for Midnight Club Los Angeles.</div><br>
        <span class="toplink"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=8">READ MORE</a></span>
        <div id="article-item-spacer">.</div>
    
    
        	        <span class="news-headline-text-large"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=7">MIDNIGHT CLUB LOS ANGELES US MULTIPLAYER DEBUT AT PAX</a></span><br>
        <span class="news-headline-text-date">08.29.08<br/><br/></span>
        <div id="article-text">At the 5th annual Penny Arcade Expo (PAX) this weekend, gamers attending the show will have a first chance to go hands-on with Midnight Club Los Angeles multiplayer.</div><br>
        <span class="toplink"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=7">READ MORE</a></span>
        <div id="article-item-spacer">.</div>
    
    
        	        <span class="news-headline-text-large"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=6">OFFICIAL TRAILER #3 DEBUT</a></span><br>
        <span class="news-headline-text-date">08.21.08<br/><br/></span>
        <div id="article-text">Check out the <a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/videos/">VIDEOS</a> section for the release of the third official trailer for Midnight Club Los Angeles, featuring the award-winning, mid-engine masterpiece... the Audi R8 tearing through the City of Angels in style.</div><br>
        <span class="toplink"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=6">READ MORE</a></span>
        <div id="article-item-spacer">.</div>
    
    
        	        <span class="news-headline-text-large"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=5">MIDNIGHT CLUB LOS ANGELES OFFICIAL SITE LAUNCH</a></span><br>
        <span class="news-headline-text-date">08.07.08<br/><br/></span>
        <div id="article-text">Welcome back to the Midnight Club.  Today marks the debut of the <a target="_blank" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/#/los-angeles/">official website for Midnight Club Los Angeles</u></a>, featuring the first stop on our guided tour of the City of Angels – <a target="_blank" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/#/los-angeles/">HOLLYWOOD</a>.</div><br>
        <span class="toplink"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=5">READ MORE</a></span>
        <div id="article-item-spacer">.</div>
    
    
        	        <span class="news-headline-text-large"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=4">MIDNIGHT CLUB LOS ANGELES OFFICIAL WIDGET &amp; DOWNLOADS</a></span><br>
        <span class="news-headline-text-date">08.07.08<br/><br/></span>
        <div id="article-text">Visit the <a target="_blank" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/downloads">DOWNLOADS</u></a> section of the <a target="_blank" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/#/los-angeles/">Official Midnight Club Los Angeles Website</u></a> to grab the <strong>Official Midnight Club Los Angeles Widget</strong> -- with dynamically updated Videos, Screenshots, News and info about the game that will be continuously updated leading up to Midnight Club Los Angeles' launch on October 21st 2008.</div><br>
        <span class="toplink"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=4">READ MORE</a></span>
        <div id="article-item-spacer">.</div>
    
    
        	        <span class="news-headline-text-large"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=3">GAMESRADAR'S "10 REASONS MIDNIGHT CLUB LOS ANGELES WILL ROCK YOUR PANTS"</a></span><br>
        <span class="news-headline-text-date">08.07.08<br/><br/></span>
        <div id="article-text">GamesRadar has posted their top 10 reasons why the upcoming release of Midnight Club Los Angeles has them excited.</div><br>
        <span class="toplink"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=3">READ MORE</a></span>
        <div id="article-item-spacer">.</div>
    
    
        	        <span class="news-headline-text-large"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=2">GAME INFORMER HANDS–ON PREVIEW</a></span><br>
        <span class="news-headline-text-date">08.07.08<br/><br/></span>
        <div id="article-text">Pick up the August issue of Game Informer, available on newsstands now, for a special early hands-on preview of Midnight Club Los Angeles.</div><br>
        <span class="toplink"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=2">READ MORE</a></span>
        <div id="article-item-spacer">.</div>
    
    
        	        <span class="news-headline-text-large"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=1">MIDNIGHT CLUB LOS ANGELES AT THE DUB SHOW TOUR 2008</a></span><br>
        <span class="news-headline-text-date">08.07.08<br/><br/></span>
        <div id="article-text">We are proud to be featuring Midnight Club Los Angeles all summer long at the Dub Show Tour 2008 - the world's largest custom auto show and concert tour, presented by renowned automotive customization enthusiasts, DUB Magazine.</div><br>
        <span class="toplink"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090228191202/http://www.rockstargames.com/midnightclubLA/news/?id=1">READ MORE</a></span>
        <div id="article-item-spacer">.</div>
    
    
